# Legacy signing files are no longer read by Gradle. Do not put passwords here.
# Inject these process environment variables from your OS vault/secret manager:
# ANDROID_KEYSTORE_PATH: absolute path to an existing keystore OUTSIDE the repository
# ANDROID_KEYSTORE_PASSWORD: keystore password
# ANDROID_KEY_ALIAS: upload key alias
# ANDROID_KEY_PASSWORD: key password
# ANDROID_REQUIRE_RELEASE_SIGNING=true: mandatory for publishable builds
# See docs/security/06-implementation.md for migration and verification.
